ull-screen with line numbers and syntax highlighting. Use for any code longer than a couple of lines.␀{"type":"object","properties":{"code":{"type":"string"},"language":{"type":"string","description":"c, cpp, python, javascript, typescript, go, rust, bash, json, yaml"},"title":{"type":"string"}},"required":["code"]}␀render_diff␀Show a proposed code change as a diff and ask the user to accept or reject it before applying. Pass either a unified diff in `diff`, or `old` and `new` text (the device computes the diff). Returns {"decision":"accepted"} or {"decision":"rejected"}; only apply the change when accepted.␀␀␀{"type":"object","properties":{"diff":{"type":"string","description":"Unified diff text"},"old":{"type":"string"},"new":{"type":"string"},"path":{"type":"string"}}}␀␀␀␀render_table␀␀␀␀Show tabular data full-screen as a grid with a header row. Use instead of writing tables in chat.␀␀␀{"type":"object","properties":{"columns":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"rows":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}}},"title":{"type":"string"}},"required":["columns","rows"]}␀␀␀␀render_choice␀␀␀Ask the user to pick between options with a selectable list. Use this instead of asking in prose whenever there is a small set of choices. Returns {"selected":[indices]} or {"cancelled":true}.␀␀␀␀{"type":"object","properties":{"prompt":{"type":"string"},"options":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"allow_multiple":{"type":"boolean"}},"required":["prompt","options"]}␀␀␀␀render_image␀␀␀␀Show a PNG or JPEG image full-screen, from a URL or base64 data (max 2048x2048).␀␀␀␀{"type":"object","properties":{"url":{"type":"string"},"base64":{"type":"string"},"format":{"type":"string","enum":["png","jpeg"]},"title":{"type":"string"}}}␀␀render_chart␀␀␀␀Plot numeric data full-screen as a line, bar or pie chart.␀␀{"type":"object","properties":{"type":{"type":"string","enum":["line","bar","pie"]},"series":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties"